OL,3,AEU-UK talks going down to the wire,
OL,4,Asays No 10
OL,5,
OL,6,FNegotiations between the EU and UK are
OL,7,F"going down to the wire" ahead of
OL,8,FFriday's summit in Brussels, Downing
OL,9,FStreet has said.
OL,11,FThe summit is aimed at reaching new
OL,12,Fagreements between the two sides on
OL,13,Ffood trade rules, visas for young
OL,14,Fpeople and carbon emissions pricing.
OL,16,FSources have told the BBC the UK is set
OL,17,Fto agree to a quota of 100,000 young
OL,18,Fpeople per year coming to the UK as
OL,19,Fpart of a new youth mobility scheme.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
